WEBVTT

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.068
So how do we do that?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.610
Well, it turns out
there's really only two options.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:09.630
The first option is,
in effect, to ban fossil fuels.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.696
That's what "absolute zero" means.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:17.406
No one allowed to extract,
sell, or use fossil fuels

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:21.083
anywhere in the world
on pain of a massive fine.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:25.361
If that sounds unlikely,
it's because it is.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:29.126
And even if a global ban were possible,

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:32.603
do you or I in wealthy countries in 2020